# Untapping the Vault means no upkeep trigger; tapping it afterward with zero counters adds no mana (CR 603.4, 605.1a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Bottomless Vault
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Bottomless Vault.Play
Bot1.Accept
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Activate(X: 0)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Mana =
? Bot1.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Tapped = true
